---
/*
 * MFASuccessTroubleshootingChecklist.astro
 *
 * Purpose:
 * Provides a practical evidence-first checklist for administrators
 * troubleshooting cases where MFA succeeds but access is still denied.
 *
 * The checklist follows the article's investigation order:
 * Authentication → Authentication Strength → Conditional Access →
 * Grant Controls → Context → Session → Remediation.
 *
 * Self-contained Astro component.
 */
---

<section
  class="mstc"
  data-mstc
  aria-labelledby="mstc-title"
>
  <div class="mstc__header">
    <div class="mstc__header-copy">
      <p class="mstc__eyebrow">Administrator checklist</p>

      <h3 id="mstc-title">
        MFA succeeded. Work through the evidence.
      </h3>

      <p class="mstc__intro">
        Use this checklist to identify the requirement that remained
        unsatisfied before changing a Conditional Access policy.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mstc__progress" aria-live="polite">
      <strong data-progress>0 / 18</strong>
      <span>checks complete</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="mstc__progress-bar"
    role="progressbar"
    aria-label="Troubleshooting checklist progress"
    aria-valuemin="0"
    aria-valuemax="18"
    aria-valuenow="0"
    data-progressbar
  >
    <span data-progress-fill></span>
  </div>

  <div class="mstc__groups">
    <fieldset class="mstc__group">
      <legend>
        <span class="mstc__group-number">01</span>
        Authentication
      </legend>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Did primary authentication succeed?</strong>
          <small>Confirm the sign-in reached the expected authentication state.</small>
        </span>
      </label>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Did MFA complete?</strong>
          <small>Verify the actual authentication result rather than relying only on the user's report.</small>
        </span>
      </label>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Which authentication method was used?</strong>
          <small>Review Authentication details before deciding what the MFA result means.</small>
        </span>
      </label>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset class="mstc__group">
      <legend>
        <span class="mstc__group-number">02</span>
        Authentication strength
      </legend>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Did the policy require a specific authentication strength?</strong>
          <small>Check whether the policy requires a stronger method than ordinary MFA.</small>
        </span>
      </label>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Did the actual method satisfy that strength?</strong>
          <small>Compare the recorded authentication method with the policy requirement.</small>
        </span>
      </label>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset class="mstc__group">
      <legend>
        <span class="mstc__group-number">03</span>
        Conditional Access
      </legend>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Which policies applied?</strong>
          <small>Separate applicable policies from policies that were not applied.</small>
        </span>
      </label>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Which policy failed?</strong>
          <small>Find the policy that introduced the requirement the request did not satisfy.</small>
        </span>
      </label>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Have you reviewed the exact sign-in event?</strong>
          <small>Use the event as the evidence source instead of diagnosing from the error message alone.</small>
        </span>
      </label>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset class="mstc__group">
      <legend>
        <span class="mstc__group-number">04</span>
        Grant controls
      </legend>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Was MFA only one requirement?</strong>
          <small>Look for other controls that must also be satisfied.</small>
        </span>
      </label>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Was a compliant or hybrid-joined device required?</strong>
          <small>Check Device info and the relevant Conditional Access requirement.</small>
        </span>
      </label>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Was an approved client or app protection required?</strong>
          <small>Confirm whether the client or application met the policy requirement.</small>
        </span>
      </label>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Were multiple grant controls combined?</strong>
          <small>One successful control does not compensate for another unmet control.</small>
        </span>
      </label>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset class="mstc__group">
      <legend>
        <span class="mstc__group-number">05</span>
        Authentication Context
      </legend>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Was Authentication Context involved?</strong>
          <small>Check whether a sensitive resource or action introduced another requirement.</small>
        </span>
      </label>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Was step-up authentication triggered?</strong>
          <small>Determine whether the additional context requirement was satisfied.</small>
        </span>
      </label>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset class="mstc__group">
      <legend>
        <span class="mstc__group-number">06</span>
        Session
      </legend>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Was access actually denied?</strong>
          <small>Separate an access-denied result from a session that was granted with restrictions.</small>
        </span>
      </label>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Was access granted with a restricted session?</strong>
          <small>Check whether session controls explain the user's experience after authentication.</small>
        </span>
      </label>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset class="mstc__group">
      <legend>
        <span class="mstc__group-number">07</span>
        Remediation
      </legend>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Can the failed requirement be fixed directly?</strong>
          <small>Target the root cause instead of weakening an unrelated control.</small>
        </span>
      </label>

      <label class="mstc__item">
        <input type="checkbox" data-check />
        <span class="mstc__checkbox" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="mstc__item-body">
          <strong>Can the proposed change be validated with Report-only or What If?</strong>
          <small>Validate the intended evaluation before changing production enforcement.</small>
        </span>
      </label>
    </fieldset>
  </div>

  <div class="mstc__result" data-result aria-live="polite">
    <div>
      <span class="mstc__result-kicker">Investigation status</span>
      <h4 data-result-title>Start with the exact sign-in event.</h4>
      <p data-result-description>
        Complete the checks that apply to the incident. The objective is to
        identify the unmet requirement before changing policy.
      </p>
    </div>

    <span class="mstc__result-state" data-result-state>
      Evidence first
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="mstc__actions">
    <button type="button" class="mstc__reset" data-reset>
      Reset checklist
    </button>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const root = document.querySelector("[data-mstc]");

  if (root) {
    const checks = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll("[data-check]"));
    const progress = root.querySelector("[data-progress]");
    const progressBar = root.querySelector("[data-progressbar]");
    const progressFill = root.querySelector("[data-progress-fill]");
    const resultTitle = root.querySelector("[data-result-title]");
    const resultDescription = root.querySelector("[data-result-description]");
    const resultState = root.querySelector("[data-result-state]");
    const reset = root.querySelector("[data-reset]");

    const update = () => {
      const completed = checks.filter((check) => check.checked).length;
      const total = checks.length;
      const percentage = total ? Math.round((completed / total) * 100) : 0;

      progress.textContent = `${completed} / ${total}`;
      progressBar.setAttribute("aria-valuenow", String(completed));
      progressFill.style.width = `${percentage}%`;

      if (completed === 0) {
        resultTitle.textContent = "Start with the exact sign-in event.";
        resultDescription.textContent =
          "Complete the checks that apply to the incident. The objective is to identify the unmet requirement before changing policy.";
        resultState.textContent = "Evidence first";
        root.dataset.state = "start";
      } else if (completed < total) {
        resultTitle.textContent = "Keep tracing the evidence.";
        resultDescription.textContent =
          "MFA success is only one part of the investigation. Continue until the failed requirement and its cause are clear.";
        resultState.textContent = `${percentage}% reviewed`;
        root.dataset.state = "progress";
      } else {
        resultTitle.textContent = "Investigation path completed.";
        resultDescription.textContent =
          "You have worked through the evidence areas. The next step should target the requirement that actually failed rather than changing MFA by default.";
        resultState.textContent = "Ready to remediate";
        root.dataset.state = "complete";
      }
    };

    checks.forEach((check) => {
      check.addEventListener("change", update);
    });

    reset.addEventListener("click", () => {
      checks.forEach((check) => {
        check.checked = false;
      });

      update();
    });

    update();
  }
</script>

<style>
  .mstc {
    --mstc-surface: var(--surface-primary, #ffffff);
    --mstc-surface-soft: var(--surface-secondary, #f8fafc);
    --mstc-text: var(--text-primary, #0f172a);
    --mstc-text-secondary: var(--text-secondary, #475569);
    --mstc-text-tertiary: var(--text-tertiary, #64748b);
    --mstc-border: var(--border-default, #dbe3ec);
    --mstc-border-soft: var(--border-subtle, #e7edf4);
    --mstc-accent: var(--color-accent, #4ea1e0);
    --mstc-success: var(--color-success, #15803d);

    width: 100%;
    margin-block: var(--space-10, 2.5rem);
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    color: var(--mstc-text);
    background: var(--mstc-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--mstc-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 0.875rem);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm, 0 1px 2px rgb(15 23 42 / 0.06));
  }

  .mstc__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-6, 1.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .mstc__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    color: var(--mstc-accent);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs, 0.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .mstc h3,
  .mstc h4,
  .mstc p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .mstc h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .mstc__intro {
    max-width: 70ch;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--mstc-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .mstc__progress {
    display: grid;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    min-width: 5rem;
    justify-items: end;
    gap: 0.1rem;
  }

  .mstc__progress strong {
    color: var(--mstc-accent);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg, 1.1rem);
  }

  .mstc__progress span {
    color: var(--mstc-text-tertiary);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs, 0.75rem);
  }

  .mstc__progress-bar {
    width: 100%;
    height: 0.35rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6, 1.5rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--mstc-surface-soft);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .mstc__progress-bar span {
    display: block;
    width: 0;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--mstc-accent);
    border-radius: inherit;
    transition: width 180ms ease;
  }

  .mstc__groups {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4, 1rem);
  }

  .mstc__group {
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--mstc-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 0.65rem);
  }

  .mstc__group legend {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--mstc-text);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm, 0.875rem);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .mstc__group-number {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--mstc-accent);
    background: color-mix(
      in srgb,
      var(--mstc-accent) 8%,
      var(--mstc-surface)
    );
    border: 1px solid color-mix(
      in srgb,
      var(--mstc-accent) 30%,
      var(--mstc-border)
    );
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs, 0.7rem);
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .mstc__item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--mstc-surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--mstc-border-soft);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm, 0.5rem);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      border-color 160ms ease,
      background-color 160ms ease,
      box-shadow 160ms ease;
  }

  .mstc__item:hover {
    border-color: var(--mstc-accent);
  }

  .mstc__item:has(input:focus-visible) {
    outline: 2px solid var(--mstc-accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .mstc__item:has(input:checked) {
    background: color-mix(
      in srgb,
      var(--mstc-success) 7%,
      var(--mstc-surface)
    );
    border-color: color-mix(
      in srgb,
      var(--mstc-success) 35%,
      var(--mstc-border)
    );
  }

  .mstc__item input {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .mstc__checkbox {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.15rem;
    height: 1.15rem;
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
    background: var(--mstc-surface);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--mstc-text-tertiary);
    border-radius: 0.3rem;
  }

  .mstc__checkbox::after {
    width: 0.32rem;
    height: 0.58rem;
    border-right: 2px solid currentColor;
    border-bottom: 2px solid currentColor;
    color: var(--mstc-success);
    content: "";
    opacity: 0;
    transform: rotate(45deg) translate(-1px, -1px);
  }

  .mstc__item:has(input:checked) .mstc__checkbox {
    border-color: var(--mstc-success);
  }

  .mstc__item:has(input:checked) .mstc__checkbox::after {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .mstc__item-body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .mstc__item-body strong {
    color: var(--mstc-text);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm, 0.875rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .mstc__item-body small {
    color: var(--mstc-text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs, 0.75rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .mstc__result {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-6, 1.5rem);
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    background: var(--mstc-surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--mstc-border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--mstc-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 0.65rem);
  }

  .mstc__result-kicker {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    color: var(--mstc-text-tertiary);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs, 0.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .mstc__result h4 {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--mstc-text);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg, 1.1rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .mstc__result p {
    max-width: 70ch;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--mstc-text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm, 0.875rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .mstc__result-state {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.65rem;
    color: var(--mstc-accent);
    background: color-mix(
      in srgb,
      var(--mstc-accent) 8%,
      var(--mstc-surface)
    );
    border: 1px solid color-mix(
      in srgb,
      var(--mstc-accent) 30%,
      var(--mstc-border)
    );
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs, 0.75rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .mstc__actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
  }

  .mstc__reset {
    padding: 0.45rem 0.7rem;
    color: var(--mstc-text-secondary);
    background: var(--mstc-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--mstc-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm, 0.5rem);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs, 0.75rem);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .mstc__reset:hover {
    color: var(--mstc-text);
    border-color: var(--mstc-accent);
  }

  .mstc__reset:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--mstc-accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .mstc__groups {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .mstc {
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .mstc__header {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.9rem;
    }

    .mstc__progress {
      justify-items: start;
    }

    .mstc__result {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .mstc__result-state {
      white-space: normal;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .mstc__progress-bar span,
    .mstc__item {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
